      "FRESHMAN COUNSELOR: We’ve got a live one!\nJASMINE: Barely. After that flight.\nFRESHMAN COUNSELOR: Last name first name?\nFRESHMAN COUNSELOR: Alright, you’re in room...",
      "CRESSIDA: Tonight’s not too late to start.\nJASMINE: Wait! Listen, I can explain. So I sleepwalk, right? Sometimes, not all the time.\nKATIE: Do you ever sleep eat?\nJASMINE: No. I don’t think so. So anyway, last spring I slept over at my friend’s house after prom with a bunch of people --",
      "JASMINE: Usually I’ll sleepwalk if I’m stressed, or in a new place or whatever. So I guess that’s what happened, because the next thing I know, her m…\nJASMINE: So it’s like... I didn’t just piss my own pants. I pissed everybody’s pants.\nCRESSIDA: Who found this girl?\nKATIE: The primal scream!",
      "DINING WORKER: Don’t be shy, now! I know you can do better than that. Here you go, load up that plate now. Mmhmm! Now we’re talking. Alright now child, eat…\nAMELIA: She’s not gonna do anything.",
      "AMELIA: Lizzo?\nJASMINE: Wrong, wrong, wrong.\nAMELIA: Ok, game over. She’s my roommate."
    ]
